Spec: Follow lap

Purpose:
  Progress shown, one lap from the join on a loop, and the ridden parts. Part of the follow tracker.

Owns:
  ./follow_lap.dart

References:
  ./follow_tracker.sdd
  /docs/specs/history/18-follow-reverse.md

Must:
  A finished lap stays latched until a flip.
  A ridden range only grows while the rider is on the route.
